<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Le Jardin de Fraternité</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            background: #090a0f; color: #f0e68c; 
            font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive; text-align: center;
            margin: 0; padding: 20px;
        }
        .soleil { 
            width: 100px; height: 100px; background: gold; border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 20px auto; box-shadow: 0 0 20px orange;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #333;
        }
        .bulle {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 2px solid #008080;
            padding: 15px; border-radius: 20px; margin: 10px auto; max-width: 400px;
        }
        .moteur { border: 1px dashed #f0e68c; padding: 20px; margin-top: 30px; }
        input { margin: 10px; padding: 5px; border-radius: 10px; border: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>🕊️ Fraternité du Palais Nature</h1>

    <div class="soleil">DONS</div>

    <div class="bulle">
        <h3>📜 Œuvre Commune</h3>
        <p>L'impôt volontaire pour la cité.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bulle">
        <h3>⭐ Main Tendue</h3>
        <p>Aide, écoute et soins.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="moteur">
        <h3>🔍 Rayonnement</h3>
        <input type="text" placeholder="Ville / Pays"><br>
        <input type="range" min="1" max="500"><br>
        <button style="padding: 10px; background: #008080; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 10px;">Lancer</button>
    </div>

    <p><i>"Tu prépares le pain, je prépare la chanson."</i></p>

</body>
</html>
